    # pov "Su tono de voz me eriza la piel, no quiero saber qué carajos quiere hacer"
    pov "His tone makes my skin crawl. I don't want to know what the hell he has planned."

# game/HORROR ROMANCE CAPÍTULO 3.rpy:2269
