    pov "Michael, although he doesn't talk to anyone, seems to be doing his thing very skillfully. Some people seem to like his mysterious appearance, as they take photos from a distance or talk excitedly about him"

# game/HORROR ROMANCE CAPÍTULO 3.rpy:3567
translate english continuacion_d231c271:

    # pov "Freddy, aunque lo considero el menos interesado en esto, parece divertirse obteniendo la atención de la gente, contando de tanto en tanto sus grotescas historias, pero todos se divierten al pensar que son falsas con su actitud despreocupada"
    pov "Freddy, could be considered the least interested in this, but he seems to have fun getting people's attention, telling them grotesque stories from time to time, everyone is amused by them, thinking they’re false because of his carefree attitude"

# game/HORROR ROMANCE CAPÍTULO 3.rpy:3568
translate english continuacion_f3c8c435:

    # pov "Y luego Chucky, que funciona como una extraña fuente de entretenimiento, ya que todos creen que es un juguete modificado para decir malas palabras o comportarse como un idiota, y aun asi a la gente le encanta, incluso las chicas están encantadas con su carita"
    pov "And Chucky, works as a weird mascot, everyone thinks he's a toy modified to swear or behave like an idiot, and they love it! Even the girls are delighted by his little face"

# game/HORROR ROMANCE CAPÍTULO 3.rpy:3569
translate english continuacion_09eb5956:

    # pov "Hay más clientes de los que jamás creí tener y parecen tan en su zona. Sonrío, ligeramente feliz de que, a pesar de la terrible idea de poner a un montón de asesinos en un solo sitio, parece no ir tan mal"
    pov "There are more customers than I ever thought I would have and they seem to love this place. I smile, happy that, despite the terrible idea of putting a bunch of murderers in one place, it doesn't seem to be going too badly"

# game/HORROR ROMANCE CAPÍTULO 3.rpy:3570
